Package: supeRwig
Title: Interactive BigWig Coverage Viewer for SummarizedExperiment Cohorts
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", email = "you@example.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny app for browsing per-sample BigWig coverage across
    large cohorts. Sample metadata and CPM-based filtering come from an
    HDF5-backed SummarizedExperiment; gene/transcript/exon annotation
    comes from a pre-compiled fst table. Parallel BigWig reads use
    BiocParallel.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
